  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the Lives of Poor Hungry Widows in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide $20 monthly support, to 20 poor widows each in Anambra State. The widowhood condition is a very stressful and devastating one, exposing women to psychological and physical abuse. In Nigeria, widows are being maltreated and face a lot of challenges like denial of property rights, rape, forced marriages, disinheritance etc. Raising at least $500 every month for this project, will help us keep it alive and we&apos;ll increase the number of the beneficiaries with more donations.</narrative>
  </description>
